{"id":"607039","name":"肉酱拌粉","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/607039/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"肉沫","amount":"适量"},{"name":"江西米粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"香葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"米粉提前泡软备用。","img":"images/607039/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"前腿肉洗净切块剁碎备用。","img":"images/607039/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒜头拍扁剁碎。","img":"images/607039/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中热油放入肉沫炒散。","img":"images/607039/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入蒜末炒出香味。","img":"images/607039/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量蚝油，生抽，盐，鸡精。","img":"images/607039/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入适量清水煮开几分钟。","img":"images/607039/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"准备好的肉酱盛出备用。","img":"images/607039/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"锅中水烧开，将米粉煮开至不硬芯。","img":"images/607039/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"煮好的粉捞出盛入碗中。","img":"images/607039/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"淋上肉酱。","img":"images/607039/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"洒上葱花拌匀即可。","img":"images/607039/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/607039/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/607039/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}